      }
    ],
    "releaseDate": "11/16/2026",
    "description": "Collects systemd service health: total/active/failed unit counts and the list of failed units (with substate) via systemctl. Emits JSON events to index=main (sourcetype service:status) every 60s and service.* metrics to index=metrics (sourcetype service:metrics) - total, active, failed counts - with alarm status when any unit is in a failed state, plus dashboards.",
